---
title: Migration Process — Railway to AWS
---
flowchart TD
    Start([Railway Running<br/>~$48/mo]) --> P1

    subgraph P1 [Phase 1: Foundation]
        VPC[Create VPC<br/>10.0.0.0/16] --> SUB[Create 2 Public Subnets<br/>us-east-1a + 1b]
        SUB --> IGW[Create IGW<br/>+ Route Table]
        IGW --> SG[Create Security Groups<br/>ALB / ECS / EFS]
    end

    P1 --> P2

    subgraph P2 [Phase 2: Storage & Registry]
        ECR[Create ECR Repos<br/>sowflow + formpilot] --> BUILD[Build Docker Images<br/>linux/amd64]
        BUILD --> PUSH[Push to ECR]
        PUSH --> EFS[Create EFS<br/>+ Access Point UID 1000]
    end

    P2 --> P3

    subgraph P3 [Phase 3: Compute]
        ALB[Create ALB<br/>+ Target Groups] --> CLUSTER[Create ECS Cluster<br/>Fargate Spot 80%]
        CLUSTER --> IAM[Create IAM Roles<br/>task-execution + task]
        IAM --> SECRETS[Link 14 Secrets<br/>from Secrets Manager]
        SECRETS --> SOWFLOW[Deploy SowFlow<br/>Task Def + Service]
        SOWFLOW --> FP[Deploy FormPilot<br/>Task Def + Service]
    end

    P3 --> FIX

    FIX{EFS Permission<br/>Error?}
    FIX -->|Yes| AP[Create EFS<br/>Access Point<br/>UID 1000]
    AP --> REDEPLOY[Update Task Def<br/>+ Force Redeploy]
    FIX -->|No| VERIFY
    REDEPLOY --> VERIFY

    VERIFY[Verify Health<br/>via ALB] --> P4

    subgraph P4 [Phase 4: CI/CD]
        OIDC[Create GitHub<br/>OIDC Provider] --> ROLE[Create IAM Role<br/>github-actions-prodway]
        ROLE --> CI[Update ci.yml<br/>Railway → ECR/ECS]
    end

    P4 --> P5

    subgraph P5 [Phase 5: Cutover]
        DNS[Update Cloudflare<br/>CNAME → ALB] --> SOAK[48hr Soak Period]
        SOAK --> DECOM[Decommission<br/>Railway]
    end

    P5 --> Done([AWS Running<br/>~$28-33/mo<br/>31-42% savings])

    style Start fill:#ef4444,color:#fff
    style Done fill:#22c55e,color:#000
    style FIX fill:#f59e0b,color:#000
    style AP fill:#f59e0b,color:#000
